// Title: Application Removed Via Wmic.EXE
// Rule ID: b53317a0-8acf-4fd1-8de8-a5401e776b96
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1047
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
